                <pb facs="0818" n="724" sameAs="frus:frus1930v03/pg724"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">823.30/96a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Chargé in Peru</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Mayer</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-08-25T18:00:00-04:00">August 25, 1930—6
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>88. The Department appreciates your full and timely reports on recent events in
                    Peru. You are instructed to exert all appropriate efforts to effect the release
                    of Grow.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Castle</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
